{"id":"reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game","date":"2026-11-07","topic":"ai","region":"americas","headline":"An Old Atari Game Defeated Modern AI in Chess","source":{"name":"Time Extension","url":"https://www.timeextension.com/news/2025/06/openais-chatgpt-lost-a-game-of-chess-against-the-48-year-old-atari-2600"},"accent":"ca","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"In June 2025, a man tested a modern computer program.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t1-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.25,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":6.24,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.5,2.26,2.36,2.62,3.08,3.44,3.74,4.32]},{"text":"He made the program play an old game from 1979.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":3.98,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":5.21,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.22,0.4,0.7,1.18,1.36,1.6,2.0,2.32]},{"text":"The old system played on an easy setting.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","M","M","M","M"],"dur":2.65,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":2.97,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.28,0.66,1.12,1.46,1.58,1.88]},{"text":"The new program lost track of the game pieces.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.17,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":3.7,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.3,0.74,1.3,1.78,2.06,2.18,2.4]},{"text":"It lost the game after ninety minutes.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":2.93,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":3.33,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.32,0.64,0.88,1.3,1.72]}],"bands":{"core1000":98,"core1800":0,"ngsl":0,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":2},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"made the program play","title":"Causative Verb Make","note":"The verb 'make' is used here to mean causing or forcing something to perform an action. Notice that 'play' is a bare infinitive without 'to'."},{"i":3,"focus":"lost track of","title":"Idiomatic Expression","note":"To 'lose track of' means to lose awareness of where something is located or how it is changing. Here, it describes the program forgetting piece locations."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"In June 2025, Robert Caruso set up an interesting computer test.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t2-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.22,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":6.58,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.42,1.86,2.16,2.9,3.14,3.3,3.48,3.86,4.38]},{"text":"He made ChatGPT play against an Atari game from 1979.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":4.71,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":6.39,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.18,1.1,1.56,1.94,2.26,2.54,2.92,3.26]},{"text":"The old computer system played on a simple setting, but it won.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","S","V"],"dur":3.81,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":4.56,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.26,0.5,1.06,1.38,1.66,1.76,1.98,2.9,3.14,3.34]},{"text":"ChatGPT lost track of the board because it could not remember positions.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.27,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":5.71,"times":[0.0,0.62,1.02,1.4,1.62,1.72,1.94,2.58,2.72,2.84,3.02,3.28]},{"text":"Caruso helped the system, but it still lost the game in the end.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","S","M","V","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":3.81,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":4.53,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.64,0.94,1.64,1.9,2.08,2.38,2.66,2.88,3.06,3.24,3.34]},{"text":"This result shows that word-based programs will still struggle with visual games.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.96,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":6.89,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.32,0.74,1.0,1.56,2.04,2.5,2.78,3.26,3.58,3.86]}],"bands":{"core1000":93,"core1800":2,"ngsl":2,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":3,"focus":"because it could not remember","title":"Adverbial Clause of Cause","note":"The conjunction 'because' introduces a subordinate clause giving the reason for the main action. It explains why ChatGPT lost track of the board."},{"i":5,"focus":"shows that word-based programs will still struggle","title":"Noun Clause Object","note":"The word 'that' introduces a noun clause that acts as the direct object of 'shows'. It states the main lesson learned from the test."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"In June 2025, engineer Robert Caruso arranged an unusual match between two computer systems.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t3-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.44,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":9.55,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.44,1.94,2.32,2.92,3.56,3.96,4.3,4.7,5.38,5.72,6.12,6.52]},{"text":"He tested ChatGPT against an Atari video game that was created in 1979.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.93,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":7.6,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.36,1.38,1.96,2.26,2.54,3.02,3.36,3.6,3.74,4.14,4.46]},{"text":"The test used a large language model, which is software that processes human text.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.69,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":6.96,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.24,0.58,0.84,1.12,1.52,2.28,2.38,2.52,2.86,3.16,3.54,4.0]},{"text":"Although the old game played on its easiest level, ChatGPT repeatedly mixed up pieces.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t3-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","M","V","V","O"],"dur":5.85,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":7.65,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.4,0.56,0.82,1.14,1.36,1.48,1.94,2.96,3.64,4.48,4.88,5.14]},{"text":"Caruso assisted the program during the match, but it kept making bad moves.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":4.42,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":5.6,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.74,1.06,1.34,1.68,1.86,2.48,2.68,2.78,3.0,3.4,3.72]},{"text":"The modern model tried text descriptions, yet it still lost track of board positions.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","M","S","M","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.71,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":7.06,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.3,0.64,0.98,1.28,2.22,2.4,2.56,2.88,3.24,3.52,3.74,3.92]},{"text":"ChatGPT finally admitted defeat, showing that text tools have not mastered board games.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t3-6.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.92,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":7.29,"times":[0.0,0.58,1.18,1.5,2.42,2.86,3.1,3.3,3.66,3.96,4.26,4.7,4.94]}],"bands":{"core1000":79,"core1800":14,"ngsl":3,"tsl":1,"nawl":0,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":3,"focus":"Although the old game played on its easiest level,","title":"Concession Clause with Although","note":"The conjunction 'although' introduces a contrasting fact. It highlights that the mistakes happened despite the game being set to easy."},{"i":4,"focus":"kept making","title":"Keep + Gerund","note":"Using 'keep' followed by an -ing form describes an action that repeats continuously. It emphasizes that the bad moves occurred over and over."},{"i":6,"focus":"showing that text tools have not mastered board games.","title":"Participle Clause for Result","note":"This -ing participle phrase acts as an adverbial modifier. It explains the consequence or conclusion drawn from ChatGPT admitting defeat."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"In June 2025, Citrix engineer Robert Caruso evaluated the digital reasoning capabilities of modern artificial intelligence.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":9.02,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":10.19,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.42,1.92,2.3,2.86,3.3,4.1,4.7,5.12,5.46,5.88,6.5,7.06,7.38,7.92]},{"text":"OpenAI's ChatGPT 4o model was matched against Video Chess, a 1979 game for the Atari system.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.82,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":9.45,"times":[0.0,0.7,1.4,2.28,2.66,3.16,3.4,3.84,4.22,5.22,5.3,5.98,6.52,6.76,6.88,7.08]},{"text":"A large language model, which generates text rather than calculating board moves, was selected for the test.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t4-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","V","V","M","M","M"],"dur":5.85,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":6.89,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.28,0.58,1.32,1.46,1.82,2.28,2.74,3.04,3.44,3.8,4.5,4.68,4.96,5.26,5.36]},{"text":"Operating on its easiest setting, the 1979 Atari program successfully defeated its advanced artificial intelligence opponent.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t4-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","S","M","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.1,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":9.47,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.64,0.78,1.16,2.3,2.32,3.18,3.46,4.14,4.76,5.42,5.92,6.24,6.64,7.06]},{"text":"Throughout the 90-minute match, ChatGPT repeatedly mixed up pieces and failed to execute basic tactical strategies.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t4-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","M","V","V","O","M","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.28,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":9.3,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.39,0.92,1.78,2.44,3.14,3.52,3.8,4.1,4.66,4.86,5.08,5.48,5.84,6.36]},{"text":"Caruso reported that he had to intervene multiple times per turn to correct errors by the model.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.98,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":6.92,"times":[0.0,0.38,0.7,0.96,1.12,1.28,1.4,1.8,2.24,2.76,2.98,3.26,3.56,3.82,4.18,4.48,4.58]},{"text":"The system initially blamed abstract screen symbols, but standard text board descriptions offered no significant performance improvement.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t4-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","M","V","O","O","O","M","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.21,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":10.47,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.34,0.76,1.14,1.7,2.1,3.06,3.22,3.54,3.88,4.14,4.52,4.59,4.61,4.71,4.81]},{"text":"Ultimately, the artificial intelligence admitted defeat, demonstrating clear limitations in visual board awareness and spatial tracking.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t4-7.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.83,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":9.59,"times":[0.0,0.74,0.8,1.1,1.8,2.08,3.1,3.5,4.1,4.58,5.12,5.34,5.76,6.1,6.5,6.78]}],"bands":{"core1000":63,"core1800":15,"ngsl":13,"tsl":1,"nawl":5,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"which generates text rather than calculating board moves,","title":"Non-defining Relative Clause","note":"Surrounded by commas, this relative clause gives extra descriptive detail about the subject. It clarifies the core nature of a large language model."},{"i":3,"focus":"Operating on its easiest setting,","title":"Participle Phrase Subject Modifier","note":"This present-participle phrase placed at the beginning modifies the main subject 'the 1979 Atari program'. It concisely provides background context."},{"i":5,"focus":"that he had to intervene","title":"Reported Speech with Had To","note":"The noun clause starting with 'that' serves as the object of 'reported'. Inside it, 'had to' conveys past obligation or necessity."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"In June 2025, Citrix engineer Robert Caruso conducted a novel experiment by placing an artificial intelligence model on a digital chessboard.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.74,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":10.83,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.4,1.78,2.2,2.72,3.18,3.84,4.26,4.6,4.86,5.62,6.14,6.5,6.7,7.0,7.42,8.14,8.5,8.6,8.86]},{"text":"Caruso arranged a match between OpenAI's advanced ChatGPT 4o system and Video Chess, a vintage 1979 cartridge for the Atari 2600.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t5-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":10.55,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":11.83,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.56,0.56,1.24,1.56,2.38,2.78,3.66,4.46,4.86,5.4,5.74,6.46,6.66,6.94,7.96,8.5,8.96,9.06,9.28]},{"text":"Despite competing against the retro game's novice setting, the modern large language model suffered a decisive and unexpected defeat.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t5-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.24,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":8.66,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.54,1.12,1.26,1.42,1.92,2.12,3.08,3.16,3.46,3.74,4.26,4.5,4.94,5.16,5.6,5.92,6.32]},{"text":"Over a grueling 90-minute session, ChatGPT struggled continuously with basic board awareness, confusing rooks with bishops and missing standard pawn forks.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.62,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":11.28,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.32,0.84,1.42,2.26,2.8,3.3,3.88,4.44,4.72,5.12,6.06,6.32,6.96,7.06,7.28,7.92,8.1,8.68,8.94]},{"text":"Caruso was forced to step in repeatedly during each turn to correct errors and keep the system engaged in the match.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t5-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":6.04,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":8.25,"times":[0.0,0.38,0.52,0.72,0.94,1.14,1.3,1.74,2.2,2.5,2.84,3.06,3.32,3.68,4.08,4.3,4.48,4.74,5.16,5.48,5.56]},{"text":"The software initially attributed its blunders to Atari's abstract visual symbols, yet switching to standard chess notation failed to remedy its performance.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t5-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","M","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.3,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":10.37,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.4,0.86,1.42,1.7,2.04,2.28,2.82,3.14,3.64,4.54,4.8,5.1,5.36,5.68,5.96,6.34,6.86,7.1,7.28,7.58]},{"text":"The outcome highlights how large language models, primarily optimized for text generation, lack the specialized algorithmic logic required for board strategy.","voice":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/t5-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.51,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-ai-an-old-atari-game/ja/t5-6.m4a","d